= All Quiet on the Western Front

The Allied film *All Quiet on the Western Front*, based on the Commonwealth novel *Im Westen nichts Neues* by Erich Maria Remarque, is a film about the experiences of Commonwealth soldiers in the Great War, and how they gradually became disillusioned with the ideas of patriotism and nationalism. 

As an anti-war film, it is the target of major protest by <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> actors, especially the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> and the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span>. They are calling for the government to ban the film. If we do not ban it, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> threatens to violently stop the film from being shown or watched.

Since we lack control over the Heartland state government, the decision to allow or ban the film will ultimately rest with the bourgeois parties.

- @ban: We await their decision...
- @allow: We await their decision...
- @allow_protect: We await their decision...

@ban
view-if: unionist_ideology == "Right" and not (marcher_toleration_heartland and heartland_police_loyalty >= 0.65)
on-arrival: guild_royalist += 4; burgher_royalist += 3; commons_royalist += 2; disfavored_royalist += 2; loyalist_strength += 50; nationalism += 5; pro_republic -= 4

The [? if in_right_coalition_heartland: right-wing coalition?][? if in_center_right_coalition_heartland: center-right coalition?] has yielded to the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span>' demands, banning the controversial film. The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> are quick to proclaim the decision as a significant triumph, leading to a notable boost in their morale and political confidence.


@allow
view-if: unionist_ideology == "Left" and not (marcher_toleration_heartland and heartland_police_loyalty >= 0.65)
on-arrival: nationalism += 3; guild_royalist += 4; burgher_royalist += 3; commons_royalist += 1; loyalist_strength += 15; pro_republic -= 3; strife += 1

The bourgeois parties have permitted the film to be shown despite threats from the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span> <span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span>. However, screenings are marred by violence. Showings of the film are eventually halted, allowing the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> to declare the outcome a victory for their movement.


@allow_protect
view-if: marcher_toleration_heartland and heartland_police_loyalty >= 0.65
on-arrival: nationalism -= 3; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); strife += 1

The bourgeois coalition in Heartland, who we are in a toleration agreement with, have surprisingly sent the Heartland police to prevent <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> violence. Under the protection of the police, the people are allowed to watch the film in relative peace.

